Description: Preroll gallery previews in opaque RGB and show their pending state
 Flat and stereo gallery previews can first display green or transparent GL
 textures despite receiving complete JPEG frames. Negotiate one opaque
 RGB plane and tell the viewer when the preview is still preparing.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-24

